{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Program Zero is a speedrunning game focused around fast-paced movement and comboing abilities developed by one person. Move through dozens of levels, aiming for the quickest time possible. Sprint, slide, and jump above a seemingly infinite abyss in order to escape the cruel simulation you're stuck in. Abilities exist throughout the worlds to increase your speed, and combining them unlocks countless strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Climb the leaderboard</strong>\u00a0by replaying levels in order to get faster and faster times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape the simulation</strong>\u00a0by completing levels and getting closer to the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock upgrades</strong>\u00a0to get faster times.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2412060?t=1751576665","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412060/f3e733bdc3d4e26408d07753dc41359b7a93dc57/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751576665","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412060/e404a7bc360d4f5bd6b02ba9b02e9e3dd5ed5f27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751576665","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412060/e404a7bc360d4f5bd6b02ba9b02e9e3dd5ed5f27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751576665","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Program Zero is a speedrunning game focused around fast-paced movement and comboing abilities developed by one person. Move through dozens of levels, aiming for the quickest time possible. Sprint, slide, and jump above a seemingly infinite abyss in order to